4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jjKFAw0nmRYQ7kNvwGutBz0&_nc_oc=AdoZSgm9d1JElQLj8wy2_FnaXtoKsd09kQXWzncfa5lKrTKtca4n22PwP3l9W4_DRXI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMx_6lpFzjsaXjjy7MgfxjJtyB29fo2QxF3ulRtzfZ4Yw&oe=6AD25914"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pZMx5-dFwJcQ7kNvwEV9h2M&_nc_oc=AdrKblufqTDmIioCK-zuiJ7MNtWWRgtjqR3pYy8Is_0KHICAdB20JiO6oYR5V9T2a7M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMNK5g-m5YClJq4UWUMj7Tmyh5ihz-HgUCZpjmQxVKAQg&oe=6AD25DF2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XFBJFeBNztEQ7kNvwGng62d&_nc_oc=AdrIc_QkZQ3pLS6faTvplde1MQt4Sf7t8poKTeXZGZyEcky0VcKRbMEVd0dUuyvzYmU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMwb5fs1EPai7QWoolyXHRq4XzMwh7_KoL7dSZTkiFi6A&oe=6AD23355"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p